WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.249
Connect everyday discounts, participation and surveys to percentages; always identify

00:00:05.249 --> 00:00:06.259
the whole.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:15.134
Find 10 percent of 80. The answer is 8. 10 percent equals 10/100, so 80 times 10/100

00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:16.077
equals 8.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.287
A group in a craft workshop has 60 learners; 10 percent joined an activity. How many

00:00:22.287 --> 00:00:24.289
joined? Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.117 --> 00:00:31.943
A group in a craft workshop has 60 learners; 10 percent joined an activity. How many

00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:38.343
joined? The answer is 6. 10 percent equals 10/100, so 60 times 10/100 equals 6.
